---
import { site } from '../../data/site';
import { langOf } from '../../i18n';

const lang = langOf(Astro.url.pathname);
---

{lang === 'zh' ? (
  <dl class="glossary">
    <div class="term spotlight" data-reveal>
      <dt>VKG 与 OBDA</dt>
      <dd>
        指代同一类方法：数据保留在原始数据源中，通过本体与映射提供可查询的图谱视图。OBDA
        是较早使用的学术术语。
      </dd>
    </div>
    <div class="term spotlight" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:80ms">
      <dt>Ontop</dt>
      <dd>开源的 VKG/OBDA 引擎，支持 R2RML 与 Ontop 原生映射格式，可部署为 SPARQL endpoint。</dd>
    </div>
    <div class="term spotlight" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:160ms">
      <dt>Ontopic Studio / Suite</dt>
      <dd>
        Ontopic 的商业产品线，并非 Ontop 的别称。二者的关系与产品现状参见{' '}
        <a class="text-link" href={site.links.distinction}>
          vkg-resources 中的说明
        </a>
        。
      </dd>
    </div>
    <div class="term spotlight" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:240ms">
      <dt>RML、YARRRML、Matey</dt>
      <dd>
        适用于映射工程，但通常用于生成或物化 RDF。RDF 物化流水线与面向数据库的实时 VKG
        查询并不等同。
      </dd>
    </div>
  </dl>
) : (
  <dl class="glossary">
    <div class="term spotlight" data-reveal>
      <dt>VKG and OBDA</dt>
      <dd>
        Two names for the same approach: the data stays in the original sources, and an ontology and
        mappings provide a queryable graph view over it. OBDA is the earlier academic term.
      </dd>
    </div>
    <div class="term spotlight" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:80ms">
      <dt>Ontop</dt>
      <dd>
        An open-source VKG/OBDA engine that supports R2RML and the native Ontop mapping format and
        can be deployed as a SPARQL endpoint.
      </dd>
    </div>
    <div class="term spotlight" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:160ms">
      <dt>Ontopic Studio / Suite</dt>
      <dd>
        Commercial products by Ontopic, not another name for Ontop. For the relationship between the
        two and the current state of the products, see{' '}
        <a class="text-link" href={site.links.distinction}>
          the note in vkg-resources
        </a>{' '}
        (in Chinese).
      </dd>
    </div>
    <div class="term spotlight" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:240ms">
      <dt>RML, YARRRML, Matey</dt>
      <dd>
        Useful for mapping engineering, but usually used to generate or materialize RDF. An RDF
        materialization pipeline is not the same as live VKG queries over a database.
      </dd>
    </div>
  </dl>
)}

<style>
  .glossary {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .term {
    padding: 28px;
  }

  dt {
    font-size: 19px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  dd {
    margin-top: 10px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .glossary {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
